          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "YouTube tests AI-powered guided search answers for US Premium subscribers",
            "articleSection": "Daily Utility",
            "abstract": "YouTube is rolling out a new AI-powered search feature to Premium subscribers in the United States on an opt-in basis, surfacing guided answers directly in search results rather than just video lists. The feature represents Google's push to make YouTube a destination for AI-synthesised information, not just video discovery, competing more directly with AI search tools like Perplexity and ChatGPT Search. The opt-in rollout suggests YouTube is gathering user feedback before a broader release.",
            "url": "https://techcrunch.com/2026/04/28/youtube-is-testing-an-ai-powered-search-feature-that-shows-guided-answers/",
            "publisher": {
              "@type": "NewsMediaOrganization",
